00:46:31,955 --> 00:46:34,509
- A little bit, I think you'll like this.

1249
00:46:34,509 --> 00:46:37,540
After we left the CM7
to it's lonely travels,

1250
00:46:37,540 --> 00:46:40,662
we picked up Rocky Jones on the radar vex.

1251
00:46:40,662 --> 00:46:41,543
- [Joel] Nice guy.

1252
00:46:41,543 --> 00:46:43,193
- [Cleolantra] And you
kept right on to Prah?

1253
00:46:43,193 --> 00:46:44,151
- Sure, why not?

1254
00:46:44,151 --> 00:46:45,828
- So he could follow you?

1255
00:46:45,828 --> 00:46:47,861
- [Joel] You know, she should probably

1256
00:46:47,861 --> 00:46:49,179
