ten-point accessory rule.

1257
00:46:49,179 --> 00:46:50,596
- [Crow] I agree.

1258
00:46:51,646 --> 00:46:52,597
- [Rinkman] What do you think?

1259
00:46:52,597 --> 00:46:54,526
- [Tom] Yes, yes, keep talking.

1260
00:46:54,526 --> 00:46:55,359
Yes, yes.

1261
00:46:56,672 --> 00:46:58,670
- [Rinkman] Decoy spaceship
to blast the Orbit Jet

1262
00:46:58,670 --> 00:47:00,141
