1263
00:47:00,141 --> 00:47:01,745
- You disobeyed my orders.

1264
00:47:01,745 --> 00:47:02,643
- [Crow] Good job.

1265
00:47:02,643 --> 00:47:05,436
- [Rinkman] I was thinking
mainly of saving my own neck.

1266
00:47:05,436 --> 00:47:07,560
- Remain on Prah for further orders.

1267
00:47:07,560 --> 00:47:08,393
Out.

1268
00:47:09,957 --> 00:47:12,219
- [Tom] Insubordinates, (sputters)

1269
00:47:12,219 --> 00:47:13,520
- You know something, Doc?

1270
00:47:13,520 --> 00:47:14,353
- [Tom] I think she's hot.

1271
00:47:14,353 --> 00:47:16,483
- I think she'd rather see
us dead than Rocky Jones.

1272
00:47:16,483 --> 00:47:18,257
- [Crow] Hahahaha, oh.

1273
00:47:18,257 --> 00:47:19,768
It wasn't a joke.

1274
00:47:19,768 --> 00:47:21,384
- Atlasan.

1275
00:47:21,384 --> 00:47:22,475
- [Tom] Ampersand?

1276
00:47:22,475 --> 00:47:24,132
- Did you call me--

1277
00:47:24,132 --> 00:47:26,075
- [Tom] D'yah! Don't do that, Radar!

1278
00:47:26,075 --> 00:47:28,651
- Rinkman and Dr. Vanko are on Prah.

1279
00:47:28,651 --> 00:47:30,891
- Excellent, then we'll have
more valuable merchandise

1280
00:47:30,891 --> 00:47:32,940
to sell to our ally planets.

1281
00:47:32,940 --> 00:47:36,607
- Rinkman and Dr. Vanko,
are to be executed.

1282
00:47:37,530 --> 00:47:38,869
- Executed?

1283
00:47:38,869 --> 00:47:40,447
But what have they done?

1284
00:47:40,447 --> 00:47:42,288
- They've disobeyed my orders.

1285
00:47:42,288 --> 00:47:43,529
- [Tom] Oh well, they, hmm?

1286
00:47:43,529 --> 00:47:45,105
- I shall see that your
orders are carried out.

1287
00:47:45,105 --> 00:47:46,188
- Then do it.

1288
00:47:47,370 --> 00:47:48,917
- [Tom] Just do it.

1289
00:47:48,917 --> 00:47:50,263
- Cleolanta.

1290
00:47:50,263 --> 00:47:51,627
It's too bad that we can't get Rocky Jones

1291
00:47:51,627 --> 00:47:52,932
to take their place.

1292
00:47:52,932 --> 00:47:54,577
- [Crow] Well it's too bad
you're not in a gopher suit.

1293
00:47:54,577 --> 00:47:56,002
What's your point?

1294
00:47:56,002 --> 00:47:56,894
- Get out.

1295
00:47:56,894 --> 00:47:57,727
Get out!

1296
00:47:59,438 --> 00:48:04,127
- [Tom] Oh, she threw
Winky's black book at him.

1297
00:48:04,127 --> 00:48:07,329
- [Crow] Oh, she's angry
when she's beautiful.

1298
00:48:07,329 --> 00:48:11,496
- [Joel] I shouldn't let
my executioners get to me.

1299
00:48:12,522 --> 00:48:16,522
- [Tom] I keep working
my way back to you, babe.

1300
00:48:20,383 --> 00:48:23,124
Hey folks, it's the breakfast
flakes with you in the AM

1301
00:48:23,124 --> 00:48:26,624
and today's crazy calls going out to Mars!

1302
00:48:29,597 --> 00:48:33,430
- [Crow] Hey! Don't use
that indiscriminately!

1303
00:48:35,317 --> 00:48:36,317
- Oh, Winky.

1304
00:48:39,499 --> 00:48:41,369
- We're approaching Prah's
gravity field, Rock.

1305
00:48:41,369 --> 00:48:43,581
- Yes, you can see Prah now on visiograph.

1306
00:48:43,581 --> 00:48:45,323
- Well, what are we going to
do about that defense barrier?

1307
00:48:45,323 --> 00:48:46,621
- You know, Winky?

1308
00:48:46,621 --> 00:48:48,282
What you can't see you can't hit.

1309
00:48:48,282 --> 00:48:49,686
- [Crow] Does that mean
you're gonna hit me?

1310
00:48:49,686 --> 00:48:51,602
- But what are we going to do
about that defense barrier?

1311
00:48:51,602 --> 00:48:53,277
- [Tom] Oh wow, I heard that coming.

1312
00:48:53,277 --> 00:48:54,551
- I've been holding out
on you until now, Winky,

1313
00:48:54,551 --> 00:48:55,803
because I promised Professor Newton.

1314
00:48:55,803 --> 00:48:56,804
- Mm, I know what you mean.

1315
00:48:56,804 --> 00:48:57,828
The cold light.

1316
00:48:57,828 --> 00:48:59,830
I never could get you to talk about it.

1317
00:48:59,830 --> 00:49:02,709
- Professor Newton asked me
not to use it until we had to.

1318
00:49:02,709 --> 00:49:04,397
He's kept it so hush-hush that most people

1319
00:49:04,397 --> 00:49:06,117
