1394
00:51:40,500 --> 00:51:42,122
- Keep the visiograph on, Winky.

1395
00:51:42,122 --> 00:51:43,611
You'll have to cover me.

1396
00:51:43,611 --> 00:51:45,287
If they start anything, blast 'em.

1397
00:51:45,287 --> 00:51:47,037
- I'll keep my trigger finger ready.

1398
00:51:47,037 --> 00:51:48,581
- You'll be able to see me materialize

1399
00:51:48,581 --> 00:51:50,556
