1400
00:51:50,556 --> 00:51:51,542
- [Tom] I'll be buck naked.

1401
00:51:51,542 --> 00:51:53,688
- They're gonna be even more
surprised than they are now.

1402
00:51:53,688 --> 00:51:54,954
- [Crow] Underneath those clothes he's

1403
00:51:54,954 --> 00:51:57,704
as smooth as a Ken doll, heh heh.

1404
00:51:59,267 --> 00:52:02,350
- [Tom] Oh good, now I can screw off.

1405
00:52:03,834 --> 00:52:05,917
The Mahavishnu Orchestra!

1406
00:52:07,208 --> 00:52:09,024
- You can see no
spaceship has landed here.

1407
00:52:09,024 --> 00:52:11,689
- It must have landed,
we heard the rockets.

1408
00:52:11,689 --> 00:52:13,260
- Maybe we're all blind.

1409
00:52:13,260 --> 00:52:14,226
- What do you think, Doc?

1410
00:52:14,226 --> 00:52:15,059
You heard it.

1411
00:52:15,059 --> 00:52:16,529
- [Tom] I don't wanna get involved.

1412
00:52:16,529 --> 00:52:19,112
- I don't know, it's fantastic.

1413
00:52:22,929 --> 00:52:25,141
- We're being paid to know
about these things, Vanko.

1414
00:52:25,141 --> 00:52:27,460
Did a spaceship land, or didn't it?

1415
00:52:27,460 --> 00:52:30,296
- [Tom] Oh, no, yes, I
uh, sort of, I think.

1416
00:52:30,296 --> 00:52:31,129
Mm, maybe.

1417
00:52:32,616 --> 00:52:33,521
- Or you'll be dropped back to Earth

1418
00:52:33,521 --> 00:52:35,207
