1419
00:52:35,207 --> 00:52:37,207
- Look, there is lights.

1420
00:52:38,256 --> 00:52:40,445
- [Crow] Hi, I'm your answer.

1421
00:52:40,445 --> 00:52:42,130
- Expecting someone, Rinkman?

1422
00:52:42,130 --> 00:52:44,080
- [Tom] Nobody expects
the Spanish Inquisition!

1423
00:52:44,080 --> 00:52:47,270
- They have discovered the
light vibration of invisibility.

1424
00:52:47,270 --> 00:52:48,885
- It's friendly of you to bring

1425
00:52:48,885 --> 00:52:50,118
this new discovery to us.

1426
00:52:50,118 --> 00:52:51,726
- [Joel] Oh he's got
yummy icing on his collar.

1427
00:52:51,726 --> 00:52:53,893
- I'm here with a warning.

1428
00:52:54,820 --> 00:52:57,434
- [Crow] Don't eat refrozen ice cream.

1429
00:52:57,434 --> 00:52:59,978
- There's the Orbit Jet,
take my word for it.

1430
00:52:59,978 --> 00:53:02,613
There's a gun on it ready to blast you

1431
00:53:02,613 --> 00:53:04,772
if you make one false move.

1432
00:53:04,772 --> 00:53:05,923
- [Tom] I like pancakes.

1433
00:53:05,923 --> 00:53:07,756
What the, huh?

1434
00:53:07,756 --> 00:53:10,286
- [Rocky] Stop pirating the
spaceships of the United Worlds.

1435
00:53:10,286 --> 00:53:14,081
Or Prah will be blown out of existence.

1436
00:53:14,081 --> 00:53:16,367
- That's big talk, Rocky.

1437
00:53:16,367 --> 00:53:18,034
- [Crow] Mannix, no!

1438
00:53:21,152 --> 00:53:22,885
- [Tom] Uh, Winky? Winky?

1439
00:53:22,885 --> 00:53:25,156
Oh for crying out loud Winky
I could use a little help.

1440
00:53:25,156 --> 00:53:26,104
Help here Winky.

1441
00:53:26,104 --> 00:53:26,937
Oh Winky!

1442
00:53:29,880 --> 00:53:31,130
- [Joel] Winky?

1443
00:53:32,008 --> 00:53:33,864
- I didn't think the Orbit
Jet would fire on you

1444
00:53:33,864 --> 00:53:34,884
to get us.

1445
00:53:34,884 --> 00:53:37,265
- [Crow] He's got some smooth pants on.

1446
00:53:37,265 --> 00:53:38,296
- We'll take that chance.

1447
00:53:38,296 --> 00:53:40,563
Get him to the caves.

1448
00:53:40,563 --> 00:53:42,421
- [All] For he's a jolly good fellow,

1449
00:53:42,421 --> 00:53:44,119
for he's a jolly good fellow,

1450
00:53:44,119 --> 00:53:46,530
for he's a jolly good...

1451
00:53:46,530 --> 00:53:50,320
- [Joel] Oh I know this
is coming up in my review.

1452
00:53:50,320 --> 00:53:51,869
- [Tom] You know, they
really didn't think through

1453
00:53:51,869 --> 00:53:55,709
the invasion of this planet too well.

1454
00:53:55,709 --> 00:53:56,801
- [Rinkman] Cleolanta?

1455
00:53:56,801 --> 00:53:57,841
- Yes.

1456
00:53:57,841 --> 00:53:59,300
- [Rinkman] This is Rinkman on Prah.

1457
00:53:59,300 --> 00:54:00,905
- [Tom] I'm under your desk, actually.

1458
00:54:00,905 --> 00:54:02,560
- Proceed with your report.

1459
00:54:02,560 --> 00:54:04,384
- There's been a slight
change in our plans--

1460
00:54:04,384 --> 00:54:06,301
- [Crow] He's holding a
bottle of Pierre Cardin.

1461
00:54:06,301 --> 00:54:07,906
- [Tom] Mm, and his knee's on fire.

1462
00:54:07,906 --> 00:54:09,620
- Why wasn't it reported earlier?

1463
00:54:09,620 --> 00:54:11,617
- Because I didn't
discover the change until--

1464
00:54:11,617 --> 00:54:14,499
- [Tom] (Coughing)

1465
00:54:14,499 --> 00:54:15,332
Thank you.

1466
00:54:15,332 --> 00:54:16,165
- That's impossible.

1467
00:54:16,165 --> 00:54:18,476
No spaceship can get
through the defense barrier.

1468
00:54:18,476 --> 00:54:21,106
- Rocky Jones' discovered a new trick.

1469
00:54:21,106 --> 00:54:22,530
He's here.

1470
00:54:22,530 --> 00:54:23,854
- What is he up to?

1471
00:54:23,854 --> 00:54:24,702
- [Tom] Well put him on.

1472
00:54:24,702 --> 00:54:26,583
- [Rinkman] Nothing much,
as long as I have him

1473
00:54:26,583 --> 00:54:28,541
locked up in one of the caves.

1474
00:54:28,541 --> 00:54:29,952
- Keep him under guard.

1475
00:54:29,952 --> 00:54:31,466
You'll get further orders.

1476
00:54:31,466 --> 00:54:32,400
Out.

1477
00:54:32,400 --> 00:54:34,482
- [Joel] Mmm, lets see
I can wear a camisole

1478
00:54:34,482 --> 00:54:37,474
and a blazer, no that
wouldn't be right either.

1479
00:54:37,474 --> 00:54:40,057
- [Tom] Uhm, hello, no, hi, hi.

1480
00:54:41,098 --> 00:54:44,185
I'm Mylanta, no no, Mr.
Jones I presume, no.

1481
00:54:44,185 --> 00:54:45,509
- Well Atlasan?

1482
00:54:45,509 --> 00:54:47,199
- [Crow] Yes, exclamation?

1483
00:54:47,199 --> 00:54:50,496
- To Prah to handle the execution
of Rinkman and Dr. Vanko.

1484
00:54:50,496 --> 00:54:51,729
- [Crow] Rosencrantz and Guilderstern.

1485
00:54:51,729 --> 00:54:53,977
- Cleolanta, that was your command.

1486
00:54:53,977 --> 00:54:55,004
- [Tom] I went to a lot of trouble.

1487
00:54:55,004 --> 00:54:56,627
- I said, cancel your orders.

1488
00:54:56,627 --> 00:54:57,460
- What's the matter?

1489
00:54:57,460 --> 00:54:58,843
Did they redeem themselves?

1490
00:54:58,843 --> 00:55:00,079
- [Joel] For valuable prizes?

1491
00:55:00,079 --> 00:55:02,110
- I will go to Prah and decide
if they're to be pardoned.

1492
00:55:02,110 --> 00:55:03,556
- Prah is a barren planet.

1493
00:55:03,556 --> 00:55:05,168
A land of rock and granite mountains.

1494
00:55:05,168 --> 00:55:06,067
It's no place for a woman.

1495
00:55:06,067 --> 00:55:07,480
- [Tom] Don't say barren to me.

1496
00:55:07,480 --> 00:55:09,068
- Have my spaceship made ready.

1497
00:55:09,068 --> 00:55:10,588
You will serve as pilot.

1498
00:55:10,588 --> 00:55:11,917
- If that is what you wish.

1499
00:55:11,917 --> 00:55:14,025
- It is what I command.

1500
00:55:14,025 --> 00:55:18,156
- [Crow] Yeah and we know what
kind of weight that carries.

1501
00:55:18,156 --> 00:55:20,846
- [Joel] Oh now my tummy's upset.

1502
00:55:20,846 --> 00:55:23,354
- [Tom] Ooh, I'll have to wear flats

1503
00:55:23,354 --> 00:55:24,947
if I'm gonna drive a spaceship.

1504
00:55:24,947 --> 00:55:27,674
I'll probably get his name
wrong, I'll call him Sandy Jones.

1505
00:55:27,674 --> 00:55:28,924
Or Rusty Jones.

1506
00:55:30,875 --> 00:55:31,708
- [Joel] Uh, you know what?

1507
00:55:31,708 --> 00:55:33,786
I should of known with a guy like Winky.

1508
00:55:33,786 --> 00:55:36,379
You know, the guy's not
even good for ballast.

1509
00:55:36,379 --> 00:55:41,343
No, look at that Bobby,
(mutters) funny (mutters)

1510
00:55:41,343 --> 00:55:42,487
Who wants gum anyway?

1511
00:55:42,487 --> 00:55:44,810
Oh I love to do that to myself.

1512
00:55:44,810 --> 00:55:46,798
- [Crow] Good thing they didn't frisk him.

1513
00:55:46,798 --> 00:55:48,252
- Winky.

1514
00:55:48,252 --> 00:55:50,335
Winky, am I getting through?

1515
00:55:50,335 --> 00:55:52,348
- You're coming in clear, Rocky.

1516
00:55:52,348 --> 00:55:54,522
- I'm being held in a cave
in one of the mountains.

1517
00:55:54,522 --> 00:55:55,852
- I'll find it.

1518
00:55:55,852 --> 00:55:57,113
- [Tom] I can't find it.

1519
00:55:57,113 --> 00:55:58,939
- I don't know how much
cold light we have left.

1520
00:55:58,939 --> 00:56:00,569
- You're not to leave the Orbit Jet.

1521
00:56:00,569 --> 00:56:02,122
I'll have to find a way to get clear.

1522
00:56:02,122 --> 00:56:04,492
So keep the ship ready
for blast off at any time.

1523
00:56:04,492 --> 00:56:07,986
- Will do, but I feel like a
lunkhead just sitting here.

1524
00:56:07,986 --> 00:56:08,892
- [Crow] Hold that thought, Winky.

1525
00:56:08,892 --> 00:56:10,587
- Just keep the Orbit Jet invisible.

1526
00:56:10,587 --> 00:56:12,836
Just as long as the cold light holds out.

1527
00:56:12,836 --> 00:56:13,669
Stand by.

1528
00:56:17,706 --> 00:56:19,006
- [Joel] Oh hi, you must be Rocky.

1529
00:56:19,006 --> 00:56:22,500
I'm supposed to take your dinner order.

1530
00:56:22,500 --> 00:56:24,352
- [Tom] Rodin's The Thinker.

1531
00:56:24,352 --> 00:56:25,964
Two of them.

1532
00:56:25,964 --> 00:56:27,035
- Rocky.

1533
00:56:27,035 --> 00:56:28,438
Suppose we make a deal?

1534
00:56:28,438 --> 00:56:30,215
- [Tom] I'll give you $50
if you have a hard-boiled

1535
00:56:30,215 --> 00:56:31,082
egg in your purse.

1536
00:56:31,082 --> 00:56:33,864
- You've got something good in
that secret of invisibility.

1537
00:56:33,864 --> 00:56:35,368
- [Crow] Ralph Ellison want's you.

1538
00:56:35,368 --> 00:56:36,635
- I think so.

1539
00:56:36,635 --> 00:56:38,524
- I could get you off Prah alive,

1540
00:56:38,524 --> 00:56:40,844
in exchange for that secret.

1541
00:56:40,844 --> 00:56:43,012
- You're wasting your time.

1542
00:56:43,012 --> 00:56:46,324
- I'll put it this way, come in with me.

1543
00:56:46,324 --> 00:56:48,176
- [Tom] Join me Rocky,
we could rule the world.

1544
00:56:48,176 --> 00:56:51,166
- You mean, as a space pirate?

1545
00:56:51,166 --> 00:56:52,433
- It pays off.

1546
00:56:52,433 --> 00:56:53,898
- [Joel] Plus benefits.

1547
00:56:53,898 --> 00:56:55,379
- Working out of an invisible spaceship,

1548
00:56:55,379 --> 00:56:57,330
we'd have the solar system by the tail.

1549
00:56:57,330 --> 00:56:58,734
- [Joel] Oh great.

1550
00:56:58,734 --> 00:57:01,253
- How about the people
you're taking orders from.

1551
00:57:01,253 --> 00:57:04,232
- We won't be needing them,
we can brush them off.

1552
00:57:04,232 --> 00:57:05,145
- [Tom] Like dandruff.

1553
00:57:05,145 --> 00:57:07,280
- Yes, but I don't know
who you're working for.

1554
00:57:07,280 --> 00:57:09,801
- [Tom] Winky, quit eavesdropping.

1555
00:57:09,801 --> 00:57:11,218
Get off the line.

1556
00:57:13,633 --> 00:57:15,452
- Well Rocky, is it a deal?

1557
00:57:15,452 --> 00:57:17,040
Or do you rot it out in this cave?

1558
00:57:17,040 --> 00:57:19,623
- [Crow] Oh, that's the option.

1559
00:57:20,527 --> 00:57:23,782
- [Rinkman] What'll it be, Rocky?

1560
00:57:23,782 --> 00:57:25,063
- [Joel] Uh, I'll take the surf'n'turf.

1561
00:57:25,063 --> 00:57:26,108
I'm on vacation.

1562
00:57:26,108 --> 00:57:27,559
- Keep him covered, Winky.

1563
00:57:27,559 --> 00:57:28,823
- [Winky] I got 'im covered, Rocky.

1564
00:57:28,823 --> 00:57:32,490
- [Crow] You let a guy
named Winky fool you?

1565
00:57:42,270 --> 00:57:46,085
- [Tom] Wendy, honey, I
think you hurt me real bad.

1566
00:57:46,085 --> 00:57:49,502
- [Crow] Oh, uh, hi, my gun and, oh, huh?

1567
00:57:55,710 --> 00:57:57,207
- [Tom] D'yah, what a
revolting development.

1568
00:57:57,207 --> 00:57:58,630
What a house of ill-repute.

1569
00:57:58,630 --> 00:58:02,297
- [Joel] Hey, he moved
the entire cave wall.

1570
00:58:03,492 --> 00:58:05,193
- [Tom] Come in.

1571
00:58:05,193 --> 00:58:06,026
Come in!

1572
00:58:10,785 --> 00:58:11,618
Thank you.

1573
00:58:14,085 --> 00:58:15,449
- Rinkman's been gone a long time.

1574
00:58:15,449 --> 00:58:16,958
- [Joel] Nice booger collection.

1575
00:58:16,958 --> 00:58:17,861
- He has some business with the prisoner.

1576
00:58:17,861 --> 00:58:19,396
- He shouldn't of wanted
to see Rocky Jones alone.

1577
00:58:19,396 --> 00:58:21,638
Rocky's a sharp character.

1578
00:58:21,638 --> 00:58:23,078
- He insisted.

1579
00:58:23,078 --> 00:58:25,359
- I'm going to see what's going on.

1580
00:58:25,359 --> 00:58:26,442
- [Tom] Okay.

1581
00:58:27,420 --> 00:58:28,563
- Back up!

1582
00:58:28,563 --> 00:58:30,135
Don't try anything.

1583
00:58:30,135 --> 00:58:32,287
Go on, Dr. Vanko, put
your hands in the air

1584
00:58:32,287 --> 00:58:33,226
and keep them there.

1585
00:58:33,226 --> 00:58:34,171
- [Crow] Now dance.

1586
00:58:34,171 --> 00:58:35,245
- Go on, get over beside Dr. Vanko.

1587
00:58:35,245 --> 00:58:38,412
- [Crow] Now you, give him a back rub.

1588
00:58:40,150 --> 00:58:43,388
- Don't either one of you try a thing.

1589
00:58:43,388 --> 00:58:45,373
Winky, come in Winky.

1590
00:58:45,373 --> 00:58:47,029
- [Winky] Go ahead, Rocky.

1591
00:58:47,029 --> 00:58:48,710
Not much time left.

1592
00:58:48,710 --> 00:58:50,164
- Open the airlock hatch.

1593
00:58:50,164 --> 00:58:52,197
- [Tom] I'm sorry, I'm
afraid I can't do that, Dave.

1594
00:58:52,197 --> 00:58:53,795
- I'm on my way.

1595
00:58:53,795 --> 00:58:55,100
- [Winky] The rockets'll be roaring.

1596
00:58:55,100 --> 00:58:58,850
- [Crow] And the spaceship
will be ready too.

1597
00:59:02,771 --> 00:59:06,066
- [Tom] Well, I had a great time.

1598
00:59:06,066 --> 00:59:07,202
Enjoyed the canapés.

1599
00:59:07,202 --> 00:59:08,292
Uh, say hello to the wife.

1600
00:59:08,292 --> 00:59:11,906
Hope you don't mind if just kind of leave!

1601
00:59:11,906 --> 00:59:13,447
- [Joel] Oh, they've
got Flinstone furniture.

1602
00:59:13,447 --> 00:59:14,530
Check it out.

1603
00:59:19,111 --> 00:59:21,694
- [Tom] Ah, Rocky blew it again.

1604
00:59:21,694 --> 00:59:22,645
- [Crow] Yeah, what was his mission?

1605
00:59:22,645 --> 00:59:25,645
Go in there, get caught, and escape?

1606
00:59:33,066 --> 00:59:34,983
- [Tom] Look at her go.

1607
00:59:37,695 --> 00:59:40,217
- [Joel] Well hi, Rocky,
where have you been?

1608
00:59:40,217 --> 00:59:41,913
- You blast off perfect, Winky.

1609
00:59:41,913 --> 00:59:43,825
- You had yourself quite a time.

1610
00:59:43,825 --> 00:59:46,146
- Yes, but I didn't
quite complete the job.

1611
00:59:46,146 --> 00:59:48,240
We know where the space
pirates operate from.

1612
00:59:48,240 --> 00:59:49,570
- And who they are.

1613
00:59:49,570 --> 00:59:51,744
- But we still don't know
who's behind Rinkman.

1614
00:59:51,744 --> 00:59:54,353
- [Joel] I thought we were, sir.

1615
00:59:54,353 --> 00:59:55,586
- We'll keep the cold light on

1616
00:59:55,586 --> 00:59:57,818
until we're out of Prah's gravity field.

1617
00:59:57,818 --> 00:59:59,905
- I sure hope there's enough
energy left in the lamp.

1618
00:59:59,905 --> 01:00:01,282
- Winky, look.

1619
01:00:01,282 --> 01:00:02,115
- [Tom] That's us.

1620
01:00:02,115 --> 01:00:04,226
- [Rocky] Strange
spaceship headed for Prah.

1621
01:00:04,226 --> 01:00:06,395
- Wow, we just blasted off in time.

1622
01:00:06,395 --> 01:00:08,784
- Rinkman's boss is probably on that ship.

1623
01:00:08,784 --> 01:00:10,422
I'd sure like to have a look inside.

1624
01:00:10,422 --> 01:00:11,437
- [Crow] Inside the boss?

1625
01:00:11,437 --> 01:00:13,633
That's disgusting.

1626
01:00:13,633 --> 01:00:15,966
- [Tom] Thunderbirds are go!

1627
01:00:18,662 --> 01:00:21,111
This year's winter
carnival king and queen.

1628
01:00:21,111 --> 01:00:24,449
- I'm curious Cleolanta
about this journey to Prah.

1629
01:00:24,449 --> 01:00:25,783
- [Crow] Do we have enough gas?

1630
01:00:25,783 --> 01:00:28,387
- Truth is, Rocky Jones
has been taken prisoner.

1631
01:00:28,387 --> 01:00:29,782
And is being held on Prah.

1632
01:00:29,782 --> 01:00:31,326
- So that's the reason

1633
01:00:31,326 --> 01:00:33,108
you're giving it your personal attention?

1634
01:00:33,108 --> 01:00:34,316
- [Tom] (making cat sounds)

1635
01:00:34,316 --> 01:00:36,222
- If you were as smart as
my chief office should be--

1636
01:00:36,222 --> 01:00:37,552
- [Crow] You'd be half as smart as me.

1637
01:00:37,552 --> 01:00:40,620
- Rocky Jones has caused
us more difficulties

1638
01:00:40,620 --> 01:00:43,383
than any other person
in the United Worlds.

1639
01:00:43,383 --> 01:00:44,510
- [Tom] I want him to work the counter.

1640
01:00:44,510 --> 01:00:46,772
- I want him on our side.

1641
01:00:46,772 --> 01:00:48,661
- You failed before, Cleolanta.

1642
01:00:48,661 --> 01:00:51,578
- This time, I'm not going to fail.

1643
01:00:52,788 --> 01:00:55,288
- [Joel] I bought some Jovani.

1644
01:00:57,821 --> 01:00:59,321
- [Tom] Oh, uh oh.

1645
01:01:02,873 --> 01:01:03,814
It's the cold ray thing.

1646
01:01:03,814 --> 01:01:06,153
I think they were just going along with it

1647
01:01:06,153 --> 01:01:07,865
'cause he can see us, you see.

1648
01:01:07,865 --> 01:01:09,792
- This is the XV2 calling Casa 7.

1649
01:01:09,792 --> 01:01:11,583
- [Voiceover] This is Casa 7.

1650
01:01:11,583 --> 01:01:13,485
Go ahead, XV2.

1651
01:01:13,485 --> 01:01:15,306
- Message to Paul Ray.

1652
01:01:15,306 --> 01:01:16,139
- [Tom] Bite me.

1653
01:01:16,139 --> 01:01:18,598
- Proceeding to Casa 7.

1654
01:01:18,598 --> 01:01:22,136
Anticipate arrival at, uh, 400 solar time.

1655
01:01:22,136 --> 01:01:24,630
Tell Paul to say hello to Vena and Bobby.

1656
01:01:24,630 --> 01:01:27,142
- [Voiceover] Message will
be delivered to Paul Ray.

1657
01:01:27,142 --> 01:01:28,019
- [Tom] He bought it.

1658
01:01:28,019 --> 01:01:30,019
- Thank you Casa 7, out.

1659
01:01:31,168 --> 01:01:33,295
- Well there's the period on this mission.

1660
01:01:33,295 --> 01:01:34,168
- No, Winky.

1661
01:01:34,168 --> 01:01:36,469
I think there's still a lot more to come

1662
01:01:36,469 --> 01:01:38,655
before we see the end
of the space pirates.

1663
01:01:38,655 --> 01:01:40,192
- [Tom] Oooh.

1664
01:01:40,192 --> 01:01:42,731
- Well I only hope that
Betty doesn't get tired.

1665
01:01:42,731 --> 01:01:47,404
I told her to wait for me at
the band stand in Central Park.

1666
01:01:47,404 --> 01:01:49,788
- [Joel] Yeah right, Winky, you loser.

1667
01:01:49,788 --> 01:01:52,701
- [Tom] Well that was shorter
than I thought it would be.

1668
01:01:52,701 --> 01:01:53,694
Huh?

1669
01:01:53,694 --> 01:01:54,869
- [All] Ooh.

1670
01:01:54,869 --> 01:01:56,536
- [Crow] Oh, sheesh.

1671
01:02:00,463 --> 01:02:01,701
- [Tom] Grand hotel, hold please.

1672
01:02:01,701 --> 01:02:02,923
Grand hotel, grand hotel.

1673
01:02:02,923 --> 01:02:05,290
- This is Casa 7 central station, come in.

1674
01:02:05,290 --> 01:02:07,822
- This is the XV2
approaching gravity field.

1675
01:02:07,822 --> 01:02:10,255
- What is your estimated time of arrival?

1676
01:02:10,255 --> 01:02:12,351
- [Crow] Oh, 2:00, 2:30ish.

1677
01:02:12,351 --> 01:02:14,461
- We'll prepare a landing clearance.

1678
01:02:14,461 --> 01:02:16,498
Please contact central
station when you reach

1679
01:02:16,498 --> 01:02:18,652
altitude 50 miles.

1680
01:02:18,652 --> 01:02:20,371
- [Joel] Hold on, Winky wants to say hi.

1681
01:02:20,371 --> 01:02:21,204
- Out.

1682
01:02:22,289 --> 01:02:26,446
- [Tom] Jeeze, I better
get this place cleaned up.

1683
01:02:26,446 --> 01:02:28,555
- [Crow] Hey! I'm in here! Ocupado!

1684
01:02:28,555 --> 01:02:29,722
- [Tom] Sorry.

1685
01:02:39,802 --> 01:02:40,969
Janet, answer.

1686
01:02:42,506 --> 01:02:44,918
- [Ken] This is Casa 7, Ken speaking.

1687
01:02:44,918 --> 01:02:47,354
- [Tom] I'd like to make a
reservation for two please.

1688
01:02:47,354 --> 01:02:49,266
- The Orbit Jet just reported.

1689
01:02:49,266 --> 01:02:50,849
Approaching Casa 7.

1690
01:02:52,024 --> 01:02:53,902
- [Joel] He's an odd duck.

1691
01:02:53,902 --> 01:02:54,887
- Do you hear me?

1692
01:02:54,887 --> 01:02:56,154
- [Tom] No!

1693
01:02:56,154 --> 01:02:58,562
- Tell him to contact you for instructions

1694
01:02:58,562 --> 01:03:00,901
after the Orbit Jet lands.

1695
01:03:00,901 --> 01:03:03,505
- Contact me for instructions
after the orbit jet lands.

1696
01:03:03,505 --> 01:03:04,696
- [Crow] Oh, well here you just talk.

1697
01:03:04,696 --> 01:03:06,808
- Is everything going as planned?

1698
01:03:06,808 --> 01:03:09,304
- Everything's just fine, out.

1699
01:03:09,304 --> 01:03:11,516
- You mean everything's
ruined by your stupidity.

1700
01:03:11,516 --> 01:03:13,825
- [Joel] Yeah, that's what I meant.

1701
01:03:13,825 --> 01:03:15,296
- I arrive on Prah and find that

1702
01:03:15,296 --> 01:03:17,671
Rocky Jones has made fools
of the whole lot of you.

1703
01:03:17,671 --> 01:03:19,437
- He just vanished right
in front of our eyes.

1704
01:03:19,437 --> 01:03:21,487
- What can you do against
a secret like that?

1705
01:03:21,487 --> 01:03:22,384
- [All Three] Punt!

1706
01:03:22,384 --> 01:03:24,485
- Find out what the secret
is and use it yourself.

1707
01:03:24,485 --> 01:03:26,400
But you let him slip right
through your fingers.

1708
01:03:26,400 --> 01:03:29,113
- Let's not make a big
argument of it, Atlasan.

1709
01:03:29,113 --> 01:03:30,446
Rocky's gone.

1710
01:03:30,446 --> 01:03:34,054
What we have to find out
is, how do we get him back?

1711
01:03:34,054 --> 01:03:36,983
- Until we dispose of him,
our very profitable traffic

1712
01:03:36,983 --> 01:03:39,830
in United Planets spaceships
and their valuable cargos

1713
01:03:39,830 --> 01:03:40,663
is finished.

1714
01:03:40,663 --> 01:03:42,087
- [Joel] Look, we're not getting anywhere!

1715
01:03:42,087 --> 01:03:43,704
- [Tom] Look, Jarod Palmer.

1716
01:03:43,704 --> 01:03:45,264
- My orders stand.

1717
01:03:45,264 --> 01:03:47,093
I want Rocky Jones alive.

1718
01:03:47,093 --> 01:03:48,723
- Why, Cleolanta?

1719
01:03:48,723 --> 01:03:50,733
I just don't understand.

1720
01:03:50,733 --> 01:03:52,974
- You don't have to understand, Rinkman.

1721
01:03:52,974 --> 01:03:55,328
Now concentrate on these orders,

1722
01:03:55,328 --> 01:03:56,161
- [Tom] Bite me.

1723
01:03:56,161 --> 01:03:57,958
- I want Casa 7 taken.

1724
01:03:57,958 --> 01:03:59,849
- [Crow] Yeessss?

1725
01:03:59,849 --> 01:04:01,445
- You know, that's not a bad idea.

1726
01:04:01,445 --> 01:04:03,571
- And not too difficult to accomplish.

1727
01:04:03,571 --> 01:04:06,840
Instruct our agent Ken to
immobilize their defenses.

1728
01:04:06,840 --> 01:04:09,491
- Casa 7 should be a sitting duck.

1729
01:04:09,491 --> 01:04:10,821
- [Crow] (quacking)

1730
01:04:10,821 --> 01:04:12,230
- [Rinkman] We take it
over and all the valuable

1731
01:04:12,230 --> 01:04:14,046
equipment and material.

1732
01:04:14,046 --> 01:04:16,220
- Don't fail this time.

1733
01:04:16,220 --> 01:04:18,002
